  "description": "XrmToolBox tool that generates interactive Entity Relationship Diagrams from a selected Dataverse solution: tables, columns, lookups and N:N relationships in crow's-foot notation. Hide system noise, drag tables to fine-tune the layout, inspect any table's columns and relationships, and export to PNG, SVG, PDF, an HTML data dictionary or a Mermaid erDiagram.",
