  "releaseNotes": "Initial public release. Solution picker with table checklist, column display modes (keys and lookups / custom only / all / none), system-noise filtering, N:N / self-referential / external-table toggles, per-relationship connector ports with rotated labels, drag-to-reposition preview with zoom and search, table details pane, and PNG / SVG / PDF / HTML data dictionary / Mermaid erDiagram export.",
